rd in a warm haze, with fine reflections and water stains remaining on the glass surface.\nFrom 0.00 s to 1.60 s, the camera holds on the close-up of the light box, the dot matrix flickering and breathing faintly, the red glow slowly spreading across the glass.\nFrom 1.60 s to 7.20 s, the camera pulls back continuously, and the frame opens out continuously from the light-box close-up: the metal window frame and the windowsill of the glass window enter the frame first, and then the objects inside the study enter the view one after another, namely the pale window gauze in front of the window, the dark wooden edge of the desk, the lit laptop screen on the desk top, the warm desk lamp at the corner of the desk, the open draft notebook and several pens spread on the desk top, the chair back, the dark bookshelf on the left, the decorative print and the memo board on the wall, and the wooden floor and the light rug underfoot; the pull-back rate stays even and the depth of the frame keeps deepening.\nFrom 7.20 s to 8.00 s, the pull-back lands in place and settles on the late-night study panorama provided by Picture 2: from a level viewing angle the separate room of about ten square metres is fully in frame, the four walls and the layout of each area clearly distinguishable, the night outside and the neon on one side of the frame, and the interior lit jointly by the warm desk lamp and the cold light of the laptop screen.\nThroughout, this is a single continuous shot: the camera height stays level, the vertical edges of the objects in the study stay vertical, the floor runs along the bottom of the frame and the ceiling along the top, and the spatial positions of the glass window frame, the neon outside the window and every object in the room stay consistent from beginning to end.\n\noverall_soundscape: The opening is the low-frequency hum of the city outside the window, the faint electrical buzz of the neon light box and distant traffic; after the camera pulls into the room it shifts to close-range sound, namely the fine hum of the desk lamp's electric current, the steady low drone of the laptop fan, the slight creak of the chair as the body's centre of gravity shifts, and the ambient room tone of the quiet room, with the sounds outside the window gradually weakening as the camera moves back.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A low, gentle synth bed holds from the opening frame, joined as the pull-back unfolds by sustained string notes that gradually grow louder, closing into a soft chord as the frame pulls to the study panorama and decaying naturally.","宽度":"1344","高度":"768","视频秒数":"8"}}}],"widgets_values_named":{"data":{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0042_首尾视频.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"<Picture 1>","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"<Picture 2>","type":"IMAGE"},{"name":"视频提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"宽度","type":"INT"},{"name":"高度","type":"INT"},{"name":"视频秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"首尾视频-场景-书房入睡","values":{"ID":"首尾视频-场景-书房入睡","<Picture 1>":"@{场景推镜_书房玻璃窗}","<Picture 2>":"@{场景拉镜_书房}","视频提示词":"Reference image alignment with the target video - Picture 1 (from [Shot 1]) aligns with the 0.00-second position of the target video; Picture 2 (from [Shot 1]) aligns with the 7.96-second position of the target video.\n\nintegrated_multimodal_description: [Shot 1] At 0.00 seconds the frame is the close-up of the neon light box dot-matrix screen outside the window provided by Picture 1: in front of the glass window of the late-night study, the red neon light box fills the frame, the whole screen a glowing red-orange dot-matrix surface, the dot texture crisp and sharp, its glow diffusing outward in a warm haze, with fine reflections and water stains remaining on the glass surface.\nFrom 0.00 s to 1.60 s, the camera holds on the close-up of the light box, the dot matrix flickering and breathing faintly, the red glow slowly spreading across the glass.\nFrom 1.60 s to 7.20 s, the camera pulls back continuously, and the frame opens out continuous